# Key material. Glob rather than exact names: an iCloud/Finder duplicate named
# "wallet_data 2.txt" slipped past an exact-name rule once and was caught only
# by a pre-commit secret scan. Anything wallet-shaped stays out, whatever it's
# called. This repo should never contain any of it — the rule is here so it
# cannot start to.
.env
.env*
wallet_data*
payer_wallet*
*.key
*.pem

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
